        {
          "pmid": 39909029,
          "citation": "PMID 39909029",
          "claim": "To characterize the effect of the local environment on mGluR2 conformation, we first performed smFRET in various detergents ( Figure 1 ) with a mGluR2 sensor that reports the conformation of the Venus flytrap domain (VFD). 28 The VFD was tagged with SNAP-tag after the signal peptide, and smFRET changes were measured using donor and acceptor fluorophores conjugated to benzyl guanine ( Figure 1I , J ).",
          "title": "Direct effect of membrane environment on the activation of mGluR2 revealed by single-molecule FRET",
